    <string name="info_todos_modos">• &lt;b&gt;Classic Mode:&lt;/b&gt; Answer questions from the chosen category. Play with other players and win by scoring the most points.\n\n• &lt;b&gt;Chaotic Mode:&lt;/b&gt; Questions from every category appear randomly. Challenge yourself and your friends in an unpredictable experience.\n\n• &lt;b&gt;Elimination Mode:&lt;/b&gt; Miss a question and you are eliminated. The last survivor wins. Be quick and precise.</string>
